{
  "name": "happy",
  "integration": "phpipam",
  "description": "Full walk against response bodies captured verbatim from a real phpIPAM 1.8.1 container (phpipam/phpipam-www:v1.8.1 + mariadb:11.4.4, synthetic seed data). Proves the token login, the sections/tags/locations/device_types/vlans lookups, the per-subnet address walk, and the device import. Also proves the two records that cannot correlate are skipped, and that the cleartext SNMP credentials phpIPAM returns from /devices/ never reach an asset.",

